<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Urgent: Leak Detected</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abitto Energy" style="max-width: 150px;">
        </div>
        <h2 style="color: #d9534f; text-align: center;">URGENT: LEAK DETECTED</h2>
        <p>Hello Admin,</p>
        <p>A gas leak has been detected on the following device:</p>
        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Meter Number:</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{meterNumber}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Device ID:</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{deviceId}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-weight: bold;">Associated User:</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{userName}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="background-color: #f2dede; color: #a94442; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ebccd1;">
            <strong>Action Taken:</strong> The valve has been automatically CLOSED by the system to prevent hazards.
        </p>
        <p>Please investigate this issue immediately and contact the user if necessary.</p>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
            <a href="{{adminUrl}}" style="background-color: #337ab7; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">View Leak Report</a>
        </div>
        <hr style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center;">&copy; 2024 Abitto Energy. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
